#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It made you feel good, didn't it?"
msgstr "Te hizo sentir bien, ¿verdad?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It seems terrified."
msgstr "Parece aterrorizada."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It took them a couple days to take over the world last week, Sarah..."
msgstr "Les llevó un par de días apoderarse del mundo la semana pasada, Sarah..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "It used to be nothing more than a charging plug. Thanks to new sensors however, I prefer the term \"emotional bonding device\"."
msgstr "Antes no era más que un conector de carga. Sin embargo, gracias a los nuevos sensores, prefiero llamarlo «dispositivo de conexión emocional»."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "It was always so soothing... Listening to her purr would remind me of those days... Before everything..."
msgstr "Siempre fue tan reconfortante... Escucharla ronronear me recordaba aquellos días... Antes de que todo sucediera..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It was an accident! I just fell..."
msgstr "¡Fue un accidente! Solo me caí..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It was nothing. I had a good time."
msgstr "No fue nada. Me lo pasé bien."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "It was when I moved into the place I'm at now, dear. About a year ago. There were a few... well- unsavory people around. I just..."
msgstr "Fue cuando me mudé al lugar donde estoy ahora, cariño. Hace aproximadamente un año. Había algunas... bueno, personas desagradables por aquí. Yo simplemente..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It was your idea."
msgstr "Fue idea tuya."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "It wasn't just empty words, now was it, hmm?"
msgstr "No eran solo palabras vacías, ¿verdad?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It will lead to the kind of videos they want, and then this will all be over."
msgstr "Eso generará el tipo de vídeos que quieren, y entonces todo esto terminará."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It won't be after the guards are gone."
msgstr "No lo será después de que se vayan los guardias."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "It wouldn't feel so fucking good either, mhhh..."
msgstr "Tampoco se sentiría tan jodidamente bien, mmmm..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It'd take me fucking months of work to afford a new model."
msgstr "Me llevaría meses jodidos de trabajo para poder pagar un modelo nuevo."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It'll be here soon, just be patient, and keep your top on this time."
msgstr "Estará aquí pronto, solo ten paciencia y esta vez mantén la parte de arriba puesta."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It'll be my treat! You're gonna like it whether you like it or not."
msgstr "¡Será por mi cuenta! Te va a encantar, te guste o no."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It'll find it's own way home after you're done. Just make sure to give it the pay before sending it out."
msgstr "Se encontrará su propio camino a casa cuando termines. Solo asegúrate de darle el pago antes de enviarla."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's a bit more... quiet in here."
msgstr "Aquí hay un poco más... de silencio."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's a lot prettier with her in it now, hehehe."
msgstr "Ahora es mucho más bonito con ella dentro, jejeje."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "It's a part of you. It will do as you please. Speak the truth and make it fuck you, ahaha!"
msgstr "Es una parte de ti. Hará lo que tú quieras. Di la verdad y haz que te folle, ¡ajajá!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's all my fault..."
msgstr "Es toda mi culpa..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "It's alright darling, I don't judge."
msgstr "No pasa nada, cariño, no te juzgo."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "It's alright."
msgstr "No pasa nada."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's been a while."
